WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.150
JP guards Ryu’s recorded close-range Level 1 fireball.

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.650
JP uses raw Drive Rush after the final guarded hit.

3
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.600
Forward heavy kick scores punish counter against Super recovery.

4
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.350
Medium Stribog continues the conversion.

5
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.350
A second forward heavy kick catches the juggle.

6
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:05.650
Another medium Stribog extends at the corner.

7
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:05.950
Standing heavy punch catches Ryu after the second Stribog.

8
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:06.950
The live medium-plus-heavy-kick quarter-circle input performs OD Torbalan.

9
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.000
Heavy Triglav finishes the damage route.

10
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:08.800
Normal heavy Departure is placed above the final knockdown.
